Package: raukrquartoexercises
Type: Project
Title: RaukR 2026 Quarto Sessions -- Exercise Dependencies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Not a real R package -- this DESCRIPTION declares the R packages the
    RaukR 2026 Quarto EXERCISES depend on. The delivery CI installs from it, and it
    is the participant-facing dependency contract; it is generated from / kept in
    sync with the course repo. knitr + rmarkdown are the
    render engine (Quarto's knitr engine); ggplot2 / dplyr / gt are the content
    packages; ggokabeito supplies the colour-blind-safe species scale; brand.yml /
    ggrepel / prismatic drive the R-side _brand.yml styling of the branded Typst
    payoff (day1-intro/sample-typst.qmd).
Depends: R (>= 4.5)
Imports:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    ggplot2,
    dplyr,
    gt,
    ggokabeito,
    brand.yml,
    ggrepel,
    prismatic
SystemRequirements: Quarto (>= 1.9.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
